/T (Sea Blue Shipyard Ltd has partnered with Dr. Gopalakrishnan J Prakash as a Management Consultant for Human Capital Management and Organization Development. With a PhD in Organizational Behavior and over 23 years of experience, Dr. Gopalakrishnan has worked with Fortune 500 companies and major Indian retail brands. He also serves on Academic Board of Studies and is a Guest Faculty at prominent educational  institutions in South India. At the Sea Blue Shipyard, he bridges the Chairman & Managing Director, and Top Management, focusing on establishing best practices in the domain of Talent Acquisition and Management, People Capability Development, improving operational efficiency, and enhancing profitability.)
