/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (We are committed to building strong associations with prominent shipyards, private shipping industries such as Unique Aurus Ship Management, and expanding our portfolio to include ship maintenance projects along with Navy and Coast Guard projects. These collaborations are key to diversifying our revenue streams and improving cash flow. Empowering our employees through innovative practices, efficient resource utilization, and fostering a culture of creativity are integral to achieving our goals.  )
/Alt ()
/Pg 19 0 R
/K [1]
